  "description": "Sizes and colours may be unavailable as our frame stock winds down. We will make more Coyote frames but we have no ETA yet. The hope is late 2027. Stay connected for news of this capable canine's return!\nThe most recent addition to the Bassi family is an off-road adventure machine designed to be your faithful do-it-all companion be it on long excursions in the backcountry or on local singletrack outings. If the Hog's Back is our All-Road Tourer, the Coyote is our All-Terrain Explorer! This build is meant to take you out to the roughest roads and off them into the woods on bikepacking adventures and keep you comfortable all day long going over the hills.\nColours are not necessarily representative when viewed on a screen. Please be prepared to accept slight differences in hue from the colours you see here.",
